graph TD
    subagent[Application Logs] -->|CloudWatch Agent| loggroup[Log Group]
    hypervisor[EC2 Hypervisor] -->|Default Metrics| metrics[Metrics Namespace]
    custom[Custom Apps] -->|PutMetricData API| metrics
    
    loggroup -->|Metric Filter| metrics
    loggroup -->|Logs Insights| analytics[SRE Analysis]
    
    metrics --> alarm[CloudWatch Alarm]
    alarm -->|State: ALARM| sns[SNS Topic]
    alarm -->|Auto Scaling| asg[Auto Scaling Group]
    
    sns --> email[Email Notification]
    sns --> lambda[Lambda Remediation]
